    "title": "Chemosensory Device Assisted-Estimation of the Quality of Edible Oils with Repetitive Frying",
    "authors": [
      "Jookyeong Lee",
      "Changguk Boo",
      "Seong-jun Hong",
      "Eui-Cheol Shin"
